; CLASSPAD platform.dat: object store setup (initobj.dat) for the BSP

; Math Xpander from the EXT region (bsp/classpad/EXT, docs/03): its Start menu
; link. The link and the program are ROM files of that region, so with no
; EXT region flashed there is nothing to copy.
Directory("\Windows\Programs"):-File("Math Xpander.lnk", "\Windows\Math Xpander.lnk")
